{
  "_comment": "Configuration for tools/job_alerts.py: search queries, portals and scoring rules. No secrets here: email credentials come from environment variables. The scoring rules are tuned for one candidate profile (full stack + applied AI, Lima, Peru); adapt `scoring.stack`, the role rules and `location` to your own.",
